### 1. 회원가입 - user1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "flutteruser1",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 2. 회원가입 - user2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "flutteruser2",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 3. 로그인 - user1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "flutteruser1",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 4. 채팅방 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": 1,
  "title": "Flutter 테스트 방",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### 5. 보안 코드로 입장
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/join-by-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "1VS20IP5",
  "userId": 2
}

### 6. 채팅방 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 7. 채팅방 메시지 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/messages

